{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07293","headline":"送荀八过山阴旧县兼寄剡中诸官 · 刘长卿","name":"送荀八过山阴旧县兼寄剡中诸官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"访旧山阴县，扁舟到海涯。\n故林嗟满岁，春草忆佳期。\n晚景千峰乱，晴江一鸟迟。\n桂香留客处，枫暗泊舟时。\n旧石曹娥篆，空山夏禹祠。\n剡溪多隐吏，君去道相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}